<title>RUSSIA: Russia Aug oil exports slip, mazut soars - committee.</title>
<headline>Russia Aug oil exports slip, mazut soars - committee.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia exported nearly nine million tonnes of crude oil to countries outside the Commonwealth of Independent States in August, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said that total heavy fuel oil (mazut) exports to all destinations in August were 1.8 million tonnes, a surge of 32 percent on July.</p>
<p>The committee, which does not provide comprehensive comparative figures, released the following data,</p>
<p>			  ENERGY EXPORTS (million tonnes)</p>
<p>			     AUGUST	    JAN-AUG</p>
<p>    Total Aug    to non-CIS  to CIS		    pct of July</p>
<p>    Crude oil    8.995	 1.885	83.435	   93</p>
<p>    Gasoline     0.356	 0.020	 1.797	  129</p>
<p>    Diesel	 1.673	 0.021	14.521	  108</p>
<p>    Heavy fuel   1.814	 0.006	 9.661	  132</p>
<p>oil (mazut)</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
